    "text": "……おう！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002020030,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "まず、今日は……\r\nひとりで、起きることが……できました……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500202/1015002020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……お……おう！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002020040,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "寝癖も……\r\nひとりで、綺麗に……できました……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500202/1015002020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……前髪が跳ねてるのは、寝癖じゃなかったのか……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002020050,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……で、でき、ました……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500202/1015002020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……お、おう！\r\nそうかもしれないな！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002020060,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "だからっ……甜花……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500202/1015002020060"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002020070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "──ら、来週っ……\r\nお、お休みしたい、です……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500202/1015002020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002020071,
    "speaker": "甜花＆プロデューサー",
    "text": "……………………",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500202/1015002020071"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──甜花",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002020080,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "だ、ダメ……？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500202/1015002020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、ちょっと待ってくれ\r\n……今そういう流れじゃなかったよな……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002020090,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そういう……流れだった……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500202/1015002020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、甜花はそのつもりだったかもしれないけどな\r\nうーん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まあ、来週は休ませてあげてもいいんだけど……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、最近は仕事もレッスンもいい感じだし、\r\nこの調子で頑張ってもらえたらと思うんだけどな……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002020100,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "う、うう……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500202/1015002020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もう少し頑張ってみるのは難しいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002020110,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……ち、千雪さんが言ってた……\r\nこの間……花瓶のお水を取り替えてた時……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500202/1015002020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002020120,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "『無理にお水をあげてもお花は咲かない』って……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500202/1015002020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "！　なるほど……\r\n上手いこと言うなあ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002020130,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "だ、だから──！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500202/1015002020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかったわかった。その言葉に一本とられたよ\r\n来週はお休みにしよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002020140,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "や、やったー……！\r\nありがと、プロデューサーさん……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500202/1015002020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その代わり、あんまり気を緩めないようにな\r\n休み明けは遅刻厳禁だぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002020150,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "大丈夫、未来の甜花が頑張ってくれる……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500202/1015002020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、それは未来が来た時に慌てるやつだな……\r\nそれじゃ、まあゆっくり休んでくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002020160,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500202/1015002020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002020170,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "頑張った甜花は……また、ごろごろしましたとさ……\r\n──『めでたし、めでたし』",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
